  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Pilot circular and inclusive coffee production in Jaen, Peru</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project supports the sustainable production of coffee in Peru by developing a circular and inclusive value chain from local production to the end market.The project takes as a pilot the cooperative &#x201C;Rios del Inka&#x201D; in Jaen, Peru, comprised of 145 small coffee producers. It focuses on improving coffee production practices to decrease negative environmental effects under the conceptual framework of a circular economy and climate. Focus is paid to the efficient use of water and reduced environmental impact in the wet processing of coffee with a perspective of inclusion of women and youth in agriculture, creating a positive impact on small coffee producers, better access to markets, income and job opportunities.</narrative>
  </description>
